`plant`
|--- When the caller does not have the required role
     |--- It should revert with "Caller missing role"
|--- When the caller is not the owner of the position NFT
     |--- It should revert with "CUL: Not owner"
|--- When the assets in the Seed's pool key does not match the asset and yin
     |--- It should revert with "CUL: Pool key assets mismatch"
|--- When there is an existing position
     |--- It should revert with "CUL: Position exist"
|--- When the caller has not approved the position NFT for transfer to the Cultivator contract
     |--- It should revert with "CUL: Token not approved"

`prune`
|--- When the caller does not have the required role
     |--- It should revert with "Caller missing role"
|--- When there is no existing position for the asset
     |--- It should revert with "CUL: No seed for asset"

`cultivate`
|--- If asset is provided
     |--- When there is no existing position for the asset
          |--- It should revert with "CUL: No seed for asset"
|--- If asset is not provided
     |--- If pseudo-random loop does not provide an existing position for any asset
          |--- It should perform an early return
|--- Accrued LP fees for the position should be collected
|--- If there is an existing TWAP order
     |--- Withdraw the proceeds
     |--- If the order is completed
          |--- Close the order
|--- Provide liquidity to the position
|--- If there is yin leftover above the specified threshold and there is no existing order
     |--- Create a TWAP order using yin to purchase asset

